OL,3,GNEWSARemember, remember when station
OL,4,Alaunched with a bang 40 years ago?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn fireworks night in 1986, the county
OL,7,Fof Essex wasn't just awash with the
OL,8,Fbooms of exploding rockets and crackles
OL,9,Fof Catherine wheels.
OL,11,FThat day, a new BBC local radio station
OL,12,Ffor the county had been launched,
OL,13,Fpitching itself as a rival to the big
OL,14,Fcommercial stations which already had a
OL,15,Ffoothold with hundreds of thousands of
OL,16,Flisteners.
