OL,3,GNEWSARemember, remember when station
OL,4,Alaunched with a bang 40 years ago?
OL,5,
OL,6,FForty years on, BBC Essex will
OL,7,Fcelebrate the milestone with special
OL,8,Fprogramming, celebrity well-wishes and
OL,9,Fa look back at the moments, stories and
OL,10,Fsounds that shaped the county and the
OL,11,Fpeople who live there.
OL,13,FHere are some key moments - and some of
OL,14,Fthe famous faces whose careers began at
OL,15,Fthe big white house on the corner in
OL,16,FChelmsford.
